  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "後新儒學研究",
    "sub_ename": "POST-NEW CONFUCIANISM STUDIES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以「新儒學—當代新儒學—後新儒學」的思想發展為主軸，探討延續當代新儒學發展的『後新儒學』理論，包括存有三態論、意義治療、文化批判及社會正義的實踐意涵，並檢視其對現代性與全球文明的回應。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "This course explores the development from Neo-Confucianism to Contemporary New Confucianism and Post–New Confucianism. It examines Post–New Confucian theories—such as the Threefold Ontology of Being, therapy of meaning, cultural critique, and social justice—and their responses to modernity and global civilization.\r\n",
